        "char_ying_wu_xie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling names the heavenly chasm among the pillars that hold up immemorial white heaven, listing it with the heavenly pillar and heaven vein nodes such as Flickering Light grotto-heaven.",
